---
import AccordionSection from './AccordionSection.astro';

import smileSvg from '../assets/icons/smile-sticker.svg';
import musicSvg from '../assets/icons/music.svg';
import vinylSvg from '../assets/icons/vinyl.svg';
import heartSvg from '../assets/icons/heart.svg';
---

<AccordionSection name="hobbies & fun" icon={smileSvg}>
  <AccordionSection name="playing music" icon={musicSvg} group="hobbies">
    I can sing, as well as play the piano, trombone, and a bit of guitar. I love
    to play music and sing along with friends -- it's something that always
    brings me joy. I usually end up playing whatever I've been listening to in
    the moment, whether it be electronic music, pop, hip hop, or even classic
    rock.
  </AccordionSection>
  <AccordionSection name="celeste" icon="/logos/celeste.ico" group="hobbies">
    I love playing the game <a
      href="https://www.celestegame.com/"
      class="text-link">celeste</a
    >, particularly speedrunning the game. My current any% (the category I
    usually play) PB is 45 mins and 17.18 seconds. While I played it the most
    from 2022-2023, these days I still hop on to get in a few runs every now and
    then!
  </AccordionSection>
  <AccordionSection name="vinyl" icon={vinylSvg} group="hobbies">
    I've started collecting records, as I finally got a record player when I
    moved to somerville, MA, with my girlfriend <a
      href="https://breq.dev/"
      class="text-link brooke-link">Brooke</a
    >. I really enjoy owning my favorite albums in a physical medium, and having
    a more intentional listening experience, especially since my preferred way
    to listen to music is to sit down and listen to an album front to back.
  </AccordionSection>
  <AccordionSection name="friends & loved ones" icon={heartSvg} group="hobbies">
    I love spending time with my friends and girlfriends (<a
      href="https://breq.dev/"
      class="text-link brooke-link">Brooke</a
    > and <a href="https://miakizz.quest/" class="text-link">Mia</a>), whether
    it be watching good shows, playing games, or just talking. I really
    appreciate a good deep conversation, and I always love to learn more about
    the people I care about.<br /><br />
    Make sure to check out my friends' websites via the 88x31 buttons at the end of
    the page!
  </AccordionSection>
</AccordionSection>
